#: e9251842351d48c895bdbdcfe2d4d99e
msgid "To start the TX in bind mode, power it on with the left (HOME) button pressed (for DSM2) or the right button pressed (for DSMX). Right now we are recommending DSM2, but that may change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:190
#: 66d98eeae76347ab8e24e1f9aaa7542e
msgid "The TX uses beeps and LEDs to indicate status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:192
